WEBVTT

00:09:58.557 --> 00:10:00.534
five percent of the world's population,

00:10:00.558 --> 00:10:02.424
25 percent of the greenhouse gases,

00:10:03.072 --> 00:10:05.307
but also 25 percent
of the world's prisoners.

00:10:06.084 --> 00:10:08.744
One of every four people
locked up anywhere in the world

00:10:08.768 --> 00:10:10.942
is locked up right here
in the United States.

00:10:10.966 --> 00:10:13.676
So that is consistent with this idea

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:16.336
that disposability
is something we believe in.

00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:18.075
And yet,

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:23.762
as a movement that has to broaden
its constituency,

00:10:23.786 --> 00:10:25.097
that has to grow,

00:10:25.121 --> 00:10:28.223
that has to reach out
beyond our natural comfort zone,

00:10:28.247 --> 00:10:31.160
one of the challenges
to the success of this movement,